### ai_ship_purchase_rejected_share
Share of the target ship's AI ship category sent in the scoped treaty that the receiving country does not want at all, because its navy has no use for that category (example: value = "scope:treaty.ai_ship_purchase_rejected_share(scope:article.input_ship)")
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: value

### ai_ship_purchase_value_multiplier
How much the receiving country of the target ship's ship transfer article in the scoped treaty values the ship, based on its need for that ship category (example: value = "scope:treaty.ai_ship_purchase_value_multiplier(scope:article.input_ship)")
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: value

### ai_ship_sale_remaining_share
Share of its wanted ships in the target ship's AI ship category that the country giving away the ship in the scoped treaty would have left afterwards (example: value = "scope:treaty.ai_ship_sale_remaining_share(scope:article.input_ship)")
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: value

### amended_treaty
Scope to the treaty the scoped treaty is amending
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: treaty

### binding_period
Get the original binding period in days when the treaty was signed for the scoped treaty
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: value

### remaining_binding_period
Get the current remaining binding period in days for the scoped treaty
Input Scopes: treaty_options, treaty
Output Scopes: value

