### shippable_army_strength_against
Army strength scope country can ship at once relative to the army strength of a target country. Strength is army power projection, so unit quality counts, and the shipped share is naval carrying capacity over standing battalions, capped at all of them. A value of 0.5 means it can ship half as much army strength at once as the target has
"shippable_army_strength_against(scope:target_country)" >= 0.5
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: country
Output Scopes: value

### strait_access_grievance_against
Scope to how badly the strait closures and blocked warships of a target country hurt this country, as a percentage - its dependence on the worst restricted strait, scaled by how harsh the restriction is. 0 when the target closes nothing this country depends on. Refreshed weekly and when a strait setting takes effect (example: strait_access_grievance_against:root >= 20)
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: country
Output Scopes: value

### strait_dependence_by
Scope to how much this country depends on straits controlled by a target country, as a percentage - the larger of its trade dependence across all of them and its military dependence on the single worst one. Military dependence is refreshed weekly (example: strait_dependence_by:root >= 10)
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: country
Output Scopes: value

### strait_toll_grievance_against
Scope to how badly the strait tolls of a target country hurt this country, as a percentage - its dependence on the worst tolled strait, scaled by the toll rate. 0 when the target tolls nothing this country depends on, or also closes a strait or blocks warships this country depends on. Refreshed weekly and when a strait setting takes effect (example: strait_toll_grievance_against:root >= 20)
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: country
Output Scopes: value

### strait_trade_dependence_by
Scope to how much this country relies on its trade volume through straits controlled by a target country, as a percentage of total reliance. Counts imports and exports, so a pure exporter is included (example: strait_trade_dependence_by:root >= 25)
Requires Data: yes
Input Scopes: country
Output Scopes: value

